cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "1D Bistable Diaphragm Metafluid"
abstract: >-
  Simulation and analysis of transition waves in a one-dimensional chain of
  bistable diaphragms coupled through compressible gas pockets obeying Boyle's
  law. Includes the discrete lattice simulator, its reduction to four
  dimensionless groups, a map of where the energy-balance speed formula holds,
  and the tolerance study behind the reported wave speed.
